amefreak-lineblog/3744040/013-3784628da4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/014-3bdfea0f4e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/014-3bdfea0f4e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/015-38c6da8504.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/015-38c6da8504.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n450人左右的朋友\n来参加抽选了！\n谢谢大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n啊\n\n工地施工的声音实在太大了\n\n所以我戴上了增田麦克风（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n                                                        然后！\n宝可梦中心大阪！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天还有新的\n宝可梦中心原创\n可达鸭登场！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/016-0d0b560c59.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/016-0d0b560c59.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/017-b21f9523be.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/017-b21f9523be.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"574\" height=\"451\"></a></figure>\n\n抱着头的样子好可爱！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/018-e8d38bb47c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3744040/018-e8d38bb47c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"699\"></a></figure>\n\n请为可达鸭投上宝贵的一票（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n签名会开始！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure 